📊 NumPy vs Pandas

| Feature        | NumPy                   | Pandas             |
| -------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------ |
| Purpose        | Numerical computing     | Data analysis      |
| Data Structure | Arrays                  | Series & DataFrame |
| Usage          | Mathematical operations | Data manipulation  |

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📚 Key Takeaways

✔ NumPy is used for **numerical computations**
✔ NumPy arrays are faster than Python lists
✔ Pandas is used for **data manipulation and analysis**
✔ Pandas provides **Series and DataFrame structures**
✔ Both libraries are essential for **Data Science and Machine Learning**
